 "notes": [
  {
   "text": "BUILDING GENERATOR  (bldg::building_generator::1.0)\nModules read only OUT_* nulls and HDA parms (ch(\"../name\")).\nLAYOUT writes one point per bay with s@module = W0 | W | D | S ...\nEach MOD_<T> box builds ONE bay in module space and copies it onto the matching points.\nAdd a module: vex file + spec.MODULES + parms -> rebuild with hb.py generator.\nSource of truth: <project>/tools/hbuild/generators/building (do not hand-edit VEX only here).",
